ADA-USD (company).summary_bulletpoint:
Charles Hoskinson and IO were exonerated of misappropriating 318 million ADA in unredeemed 'vouchers' left over from Cardano's Initial Coin Offering (ICO).
@FredCardano apologized to Hoskinson for spreading misinformation and suspended key channels used to organize petitions against him.
The audit found that allegations of theft and improper ledger manipulation were unsubstantiated, and 99.7% of ADA linked to vouchers was redeemed.

